	(text "THE HD63484, THE DOT CLOCK, THE DOT COUNTER, P56 AND VALID" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "82f2fe4c-25de-50e0-97fc-da3150fa3c94"))
	(text "IC6 counts the 25.175 MHz dot clock: QB is the chip's 2CLK, QC follows its MCYC (the counter loads NOT MCYC in\ndots 3 and 7, so QA-QC are the dot number in a memory cycle). IC7/A is P56, a flip-flop high in dots 5 and 6\nof every cycle: the one edge the card times things with. IC7/B is VALID: AS came in this cycle (a dummy cycle\nhas none). The chip's host side is on sheet 2, its memory side on sheets 4 to 7." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "09fb85ac-d4d9-5e01-b441-f8004a40a265"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
